The section must do:
- schedules a phone reminder for the next haircut, going off the chosen lead time before it (when the next haircut date is set)

The person sets these on the screen and nothing else uses them yet; the section uses them:
- "Next haircut": state.haircutDate
- "Remind before": state.reminderLeadIndex (the index of the chosen option: At the time, 15 min before, 1 hour before, 1 day before)

